WEBVTT

1
00:00:14,130 --> 00:00:16,450
Senior, can these hunters leave?

2
00:00:16,450 --> 00:00:18,730
If you block the door like this, you can't block us for thirty days.

3
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:22,020
I don’t know. There are too many. Just bear with it for now.

4
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:23,380
The cabin is relatively safe now

5
00:00:23,380 --> 00:00:25,580
If they can't get in, they will probably leave.

6
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:27,780
Senior, have you found someone to exchange stones for?

7
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:30,100
Upgrading the wooden house will require another thousand stones.

8
00:00:31,970 --> 00:00:34,170
As for stones, they don’t exist at the moment.

9
00:00:34,170 --> 00:00:35,890
Many people only collect wood

10
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:37,970
Do you still remember the settings we went to before?

11
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:40,000
There aren't many Suishu stones there

12
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,560
I'll just bring some back when the time comes.
